    {
      "id": "dc61be01551edd12830183a4f034efa7bb2af9ed",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2216182668,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hm, I am not sure if this is the right approach, although I have no idea on how to do it differently. But, at the very least, I would guard the integration of libxml2 with HAVE_LIBXML2 to ensure, that it will only be integrated if libxml2 was found. Otherwise everyone needs to integrate it, even if they do not require it.\n\nSame goes for the remaining integration of the file format.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2498449,
            "username": "rknall",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Roland Knall",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9e1d973c5007651b2ca47071f80324c2de5349d873e365cf0761df5542dfe382?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/rknall"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-11-18T14:18:47.051Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-11-18T14:18:47.051Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 343709180,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 18133,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 2216193906,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "What I did here was just copy epan's CMakeLists.txt. I don't know what else to do in order to handle the case where libxml2 is not found.\n\nIn the file format itself, I'm using HAVE_LIBXML2 to guard the inclusion of the headers.",
          "author": {
            "id": 18219493,
            "username": "giovanni.musto",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Giovanni Musto",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b8ca1135be5e614246a54ed49c6809a9b172aafdcb27c2db7ec5548b625e76d5?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/giovanni.musto"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-11-18T14:24:07.615Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-11-18T14:24:07.615Z",
