        },
        {
          "id": 2216228638,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Hm, I am not sure if this is the right approach\n\nPersonally, I think it's time we:\n\n- make libxml2 a requirement;\n- try to replace the hand-crafted XML parsers we have in various places with libxml2.",
